/Subj (Highlight)
/T (Sungwoo Lee)
/CreationDate (D:20231009140407+01'00')
/Popup 46 0 R
/MarkupText (We overcome the limitations of static linear transition models \(as in, e.g., Kalman filters\) using a hypernetwork to adjust the transition matrix dynamically for every time step, allowing the model to predict using a time-varying mixture of possible transition dynamics.)
/CA 1.0
/AP 108 0 R
/P 9 0 R
>>
